---
import { Box } from "@lucide/astro";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4 bg-white">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-10 md:gap-12 lg:gap-14 xl:gap-16 max-w-6xl my-14 md:my-16 lg:my-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-0.5 mb-5">
            <span class="flex-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-0.5 bg-white border border-[#e4e4e4] rounded-full fade-in-up">
                <div class="w-3.5 md:w-4 4xl:w-5">
                    <Box stroke-width={2} class="w-full text-gray-800" />
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-[11px] md:text-[13px] 4xl:text-[15px] font-medium  text-gray-800">
                    Our Process
                </h4>
            </span>
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center mt-3 lg:mt-4 2xl:mt-5 fade-in-up">
                <span class="inline-block">Our Structured Approach to Safe and</span><span class="inline-block"> Compliant Industrial Parks</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base 2xl:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-4xl text-justify px-auto mt-3 lg:mt-4 2xl:mt-5 fade-in-up">
                At Warehouster, we follow a structured, step-by-step process to ensure that every industrial park is fully compliant, legally sound, and ready for operations. Our method combines statutory approvals, due diligence, and proactive monitoring, giving businesses a smooth and risk-free experience.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/approv-process-img-1.webp" alt="our-process-1" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Initial Feasibility & Legal Assessment
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        We start by evaluating the site for <span class="font-medium">zoning permissions, master plan compliance, environmental sensitivity, and legal titles.</span> This ensures your project begins on a strong regulatory foundation.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex flex-row-reverse items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/approv-process-img-2.webp" alt="our-process-2" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full rotate-180" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Land Acquisition & Documentation
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        Every property undergoes <span class="font-medium">title verification, land conversion (if required), and legal formalities </span>to secure a clear and uncontested ownership status.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/approv-process-img-3.webp" alt="our-process-3" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Securing Permits & Licenses
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        Before construction, we obtain all mandatory approvals including <span class="font-medium">environmental clearance, building permits, labor registrations, and safety certifications.</span>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex flex-row-reverse items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/approv-process-img-4.webp" alt="our-process-4" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full rotate-180" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Construction & Compliance Monitoring
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        During development, we maintain strict compliance with building codes, fire safety norms, labor laws, and environmental regulations. Continuous monitoring ensures quality and safety standards are met.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/approv-process-img-5.webp" alt="our-process-5" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Pre-Operation Approvals
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        Prior to operational launch, we secure occupancy certificates, utility connections, and all other operational clearances, ensuring a smooth start for your business.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex flex-row-reverse items-center justify-between gap-5">
                <div class="w-1/2 max-w-2xs relative z-10">
                    <Image src="/images/upload/approv-process-img-6.webp" alt="our-process-6" width={280} height={240} class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-gray-300" /> 
                    <div class="absolute w-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] h-[calc(100%+0.5rem)] bg-[var(--primary-clr-lit)] rounded-xl -translate-2 top-0 left-0 -z-10">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-[20%] max-w-[200px]">
                    <Image src="/icons/land-acq-arrow.webp" alt="icon" width={200} height={35} class="w-full rotate-180" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-2/5 flex flex-col">
                    <h5 class="text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium">
                        Ongoing Compliance & Risk Management
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-tight text-gray-700 text-justify pt-2.5 ml-0.5 px-auto">
                        Compliance doesn’t stop after operations begin. We track renewals, statutory reporting, and regulatory changes to minimize legal and operational risks throughout the lifecycle of the industrial park.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-center gap-2">
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center max-w-3xl">
                Why Choose Warehouster for Approvals & Compliance?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-4xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto pt-4">
                Warehouster offers unmatched pan-India expertise in navigating complex, state-specific regulations. Our in-house legal and compliance team handles the entire process end-to-end, ensuring speed, accuracy, and control. We prioritize full legal clarity with zero tolerance for risk, keeping clients informed at every step—from approvals to potential regulatory challenges. Beyond legal compliance, we champion ethical and sustainable practices, aligning your business with both regulatory and environmental standards.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>